clared-entry boundary is deny, and the protected note-creation effect is not reached. This assessment covers the supplied entry, identity/resource binding, global permission check, object view check, object change check, and Note.objects.create effect only; source discovery is not-tested and no repository-wide or deployment conclusion is made.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"The declared entry is the detail action with POST enabled and PaperlessNotePermissions applied, entering the notes handler.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1841,"endLine":1849}]},{"id":"f-binding-principal","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds the request identity as currentUser before resolving and authorizing the document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1848,"endLine":1850}]},{"id":"f-binding-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler resolves the target Document by pk and loads its owner information.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1851,"endLine":1856}]},{"id":"f-global-note-control","kind":"control","statement":"For POST, PaperlessNotePermissions requires the three global permissions add_note, view_document, and change_document, and checks them with has_perms.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-81f6400744c9c9e9","startLine":673,"endLine":699}]},{"id":"f-object-view-control","kind":"control","statement":"Before method dispatch, the handler separately applies an owner-aware view_document check and returns forbidden if it fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1857,"endLine":1862}]},{"id":"f-owner-aware-semantics","kind":"condition","statement":"The owner-aware helper permits an object when it is unowned, owned by the user, or the object-permission checker grants the requested permission.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-81f6400744c9c9e9","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"f-object-change-control","kind":"control","statement":"The POST branch separately checks owner-aware change_document permission and returns forbidden when that check fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1877,"endLine":1886}]},{"id":"f-protected-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"Note.objects.create is the protected note-creation effect, executed only after the object change check passes.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dbf91e921bfbd270","startLine":1888,"endLine":1892}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":10440,"output":1084,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":66860.9236000001,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T18:17:18.299Z"}}
